====== D-Link DIR-3060 A1======

{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

The D-Link DIR-3060 (Gaming AC3000) was a high-end home router / wireless access point. It was marketed to families and "gamers" using a sci-fi design and partnerships with Norton AntiVirus, Ookla Speedtest, Amazon Alexa, and Google Assistant. Apparently unsuccessful, it was quickly discontinued, receiving no further hardware revisions.

{{media:dlink:dir_3060_front.png?400}}

